    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_7919b99978bdf36b0f071ffae537086b1f5af2a9ab06e222f6063c9ee9fcd88e",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The paper's shared-variable exponential dilates instantiate the survival-function/Müntz gNB construction, whereas its concentrating triangular Gamma variables instantiate the reciprocal-integer perturbation theorem and its samplewise pNB route; the examples therefore probe different mechanisms rather than serving as interchangeable random laws.",
