      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "For the survival function f(t)=P(X>=t), the identity E[{X/t}]=-P f(t) changes averaged random fractional-part features into deterministic Müntz transforms; under RH, the strong deterministic approximation can therefore be transported to gNB approximants for the dilated family X/k.",
